namespace SoftwareIntf = phosphor::software;
namespace ManagerIntf = phosphor::software::manager;
namespace DeviceIntf = ...

And use these SoftwareIntf::xxxx in the code.

for example, 

error("Failed to get device id with {ERROR}", "ERROR", ret);

